msgid "Joins EVERY job before asking anything, then GW_Hard asks specifically about the HARD ones — both warn-only results reach the same join but never the gate, so this lane's merge/block call is deliberately blind to a red job it also ran, and that asymmetry is the point. Counted from the lane rather than stated here: the numbers this sentence used to carry went stale the moment `Task_Gates` was split out of `Task_TypeScript` (bean `m5gx`)."
msgstr ""

